{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105495","id":2466344664,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TAW7Y","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105495","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105495.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105495.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105495","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105495/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105495/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105495/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2e0fa5d8f8f5d5ff30b19d714ca4017996f9032a","number":105495,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add apply_directional_force function to vector2","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This code introduces a new movement mechanic for Vector2, it is helpful for my game so I modified godot and got an idea to make a pr for my changes\r\n\r\nit is useful for CharacterBody2D\r\n\r\nthis is a code example (it works well):\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends CharacterBody2D\r\n\r\nvar speed := 100.0\r\n\r\nfunc _physics_process(delta):\r\n    var right = Vector2.RIGHT\r\n    velocity = velocity.apply_directional_force(right, speed * delta)\r\n    move_and_slide()\r\n```\r\nReason for Changes:\r\n\r\nThis update provides a smooth, controlled way of applying directional force to the Vector and improving movement mechanics.\r\nLet me know if you have any suggestions or improvements! \r\n\r\nand also tell me if I should add this to Vector3 too (I have never contributed to anything) I have bad English \r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12264*","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-17T15:07:53Z","updated_at":"2025-06-25T11:03:43Z","closed_at":"2025-06-25T10:56:20Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1d4ca351ac7456d185683f33c556188d65517322","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":null,"ref":"apply_directional_force","repo":null,"sha":"2e0fa5d8f8f5d5ff30b19d714ca4017996f9032a","user":null},"base":{"label":"godotengine:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":